OL,3,GNEWSACountry house to host first kite
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 kites of all shapes and
OL,7,Fsizes will take to the sky later at a
OL,8,Fcountry house near Leeds.
OL,10,FLotherton Hall, which is run by Leeds
OL,11,FMuseums and Galleries, at Aberford, is
OL,12,Fhosting its first kite festival across
OL,13,Fthe weekend.
OL,15,FThe event is organised by The Northern
OL,16,FKite Group which is behind similar
OL,17,Ffestivals in Filey, Bridlington and
OL,18,FRedcar.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
