OL,3,GNEWSACountry house to host first kite
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll kites taking part will be flown by
OL,7,Fprofessionals and children attending
OL,8,Fcan bring cuddly toys, which will be
OL,9,Fequipped with parachutes and dropped
OL,10,Ffrom kites to float back down to their
OL,11,Fowners.
